  "bio": "Step into the artistic haven of Infinite Ink Tattoo, nestled in the vibrant heart of Honolulu at the Nimitz Business Center, right next to Sensually Yours. Specializing in stunning illustrative and black & gray tattoos, our studio merges impeccable craftsmanship with a serene environment to create timeless body art. Visit us Monday to Saturday from 12-7pm and book your next masterpiece through our website, or call us at (808) 485-8282 for an unparalleled ink experience where creativity flows as endlessly as the ink itself.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Honolulu, Hawaii, United States"
